  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Food Security West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Africa is a key focus region for the Netherlands. Under the new policy framework, trade and food security have been identified as important pillars for international cooperation and aid.This scoping study aims to provide insights into potential synergies, opportunities and policy interventions, that could support both themes, while creating a win-win situation for West Africa and the Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
